{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":382055,"name":"","username":"Mathias42","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/3da27b/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-07-06T07:46:58.802Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eIch nutze ha-mcp in Kombination mit Claude Code im CLI.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDie MCP Tools verbrauchen schon über 60k Tokens. Ich kenne mich nicht so damit aus, ob und wie man das auf ein notwendiges Minimum reduzieren könnte, aber das scheint mit unnötig viel.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGibt es einen einfache Möglichkeit, die Aufwand für die Tools deutlich zu reduzieren??\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://community.simon42.com/uploads/default/original/3X/6/9/6947300c268339d071604387294280cc412e4586.png\" data-download-href=\"https://community.simon42.com/uploads/default/6947300c268339d071604387294280cc412e4586\" title=\"Bildschirmfoto 2026-07-06 um 09.34.51\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://community.simon42.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6947300c268339d071604387294280cc412e4586_2_563x500.png\" alt=\"Bildschirmfoto 2026-07-06 um 09.34.51\" data-base62-sha1=\"f1kEvjZP66SBMbVzTI7OmYM5zWm\" width=\"563\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://community.simon42.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6947300c268339d071604387294280cc412e4586_2_563x500.png, https://community.simon42.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6947300c268339d071604387294280cc412e4586_2_844x750.png 1.5x, https://community.simon42.com/uploads/default/optimized/3X/6/9/6947300c268339d071604387294280cc412e4586_2_1126x1000.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F4F4F6\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eBildschirmfoto 2026-07-06 um 09.34.51\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1228×1090 90.7 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-06T07:46:58.802Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":69,"reads":51,"readers_count":50,"score":350.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":88707,"topic_slug":"ha-mcp-macht-den-kontext-voll","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":26966,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/ha-mcp-macht-den-kontext-voll/88707/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":382056,"name":"","username":"Mercator","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e95f7d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-07-06T08:01:16.926Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eWas äußert denn Claude dazu, wenn du ihn fragst?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNach ein wenig nachspüren:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChat-Verlauf zurücksetzen (Sofort-Hilfe)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDie Messages schnappen sich aktuell 110k Tokens.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSetz die Session im CLI einfach mit “/clear” zurück (oder Terminal neu starten).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHA-Tools ausmisten\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDein Home Assistant MCP-Server ballert Claude mit stolzen \u003cstrong\u003e77 Tools\u003c/strong\u003e zu, Claude braucht im Alltag niemals 77 Tools gleichzeitig.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDu musst Filter in deiner MCP-Konfiguration (z. B. claude_desktop_config.json) setzen.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSchließe unbedeutende Domains oder Entitäten aus (z. B. jeden einzelnen Batterie-/Signalstärkensensor, Update-Entitäten, Tracker etc.). Limitiere es am besten über include_domains auf das, was du wirklich per CLI steuern willst (z. B. light, switch, climate).\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-06T08:28:07.220Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":43,"readers_count":42,"score":38.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":88707,"topic_slug":"ha-mcp-macht-den-kontext-voll","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":21634,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/ha-mcp-macht-den-kontext-voll/88707/2","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":382068,"name":"","username":"Mathias42","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/3da27b/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-07-06T08:48:43.200Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eClaude sagt dazu:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKurz: Die 60k Tokens waren die Tool-Definitionen (Name + Beschreibung + JSON-Schema der Parameter) aller ~77 HA-MCP-Tools — nicht Nutzdaten, sondern reine Schema-Deklarationen, die bei jedem API-Call mitgeschickt werden müssen, damit ich weiß, was ich aufrufen kann.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarum so viel bei HA konkret:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHA-MCP bildet fast die komplette Admin-API einzeln ab: ha_config_set_automation, ha_config_set_dashboard, ha_config_set_helper, ha_get_integration usw. — statt weniger generischer Tools gibt’s für fast jede Entität einen eigenen Tool-Eintrag.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManche davon haben stark verschachtelte Schemas (z. B. Automation mit trigger/condition/action-Objekten, Dashboard-Card-Layouts). Die teuersten Einzeltools lagen bei 1,8k–3,4k Tokens (ha_config_set_helper, ha_get_integration, ha_config_set_dashboard, ha_config_set_automation).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSummiert über 77 Tools kommen die 60,3k zusammen — bei anderen MCP-Servern mit 5–15 Tools sieht man das selten in dieser Größenordnung.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePraktische Konsequenz: Verbundene MCP-Server kosten ihre volle Tool-Schema-Größe bei jeder Nachricht, unabhängig davon, ob man sie nutzt — nicht amortisiert. Bei so tool-reichen Servern wie HA lohnt es sich, sie nur dann verbunden zu lassen, wenn man in der Session wirklich Home-Assistant-Aktionen vorhat.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMan kann wohl auch keine einzelnen Tools deaktivieren oder nur die Namen lazy-loaden. Also bleibt wohl nur, den MCP nur bei Sessions zu aktivieren, in denen man am HA arbeiten will\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-06T08:48:43.200Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":2,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":6,"reads":39,"readers_count":38,"score":42.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":88707,"topic_slug":"ha-mcp-macht-den-kontext-voll","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":21634,"username":"Mercator","name":"","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e95f7d/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":26966,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/ha-mcp-macht-den-kontext-voll/88707/3","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":382094,"name":"","username":"Mercator","avatar_template":"/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e95f7d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-07-06T09:29:33.904Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eDinge abschalten die man nicht benutzt sollte man eh…\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnsonsten clear ausprobieren und deine Tools ausmisten. Das da gar nichts geht, kann ich mir fast nicht vorstellen,wird ja wohl irgendwo ne “MCPconfig” geben…\u003cbr\u003e\n… wobei - ist ja HA- nichts ist unmöglich… \u003cimg src=\"https://community.simon42.com/images/emoji/twitter/joy.png?v=15\" title=\":joy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":joy:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-07-06T09:29:33.904Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":3,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":11,"reads":28,"readers_count":27,"score":60.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":88707,"topic_slug":"ha-mcp-macht-den-kontext-voll","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[]